{
  "name": "Check Point · Ask the security-ops agent",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {"options": {}},
      "id": "6f3c1d2e-0001-4a00-9000-000000000001",
      "name": "When chat message received",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chatTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [0, 300],
      "webhookId": "chkp-ask-agent"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {"id": "c1", "name": "baseUrl", "value": "https://<your-host>", "type": "string"},
            {"id": "c2", "name": "tokenUrl", "value": "https://<domain>.auth.us-east-1.amazoncognito.com/oauth2/token", "type": "string"},
            {"id": "c3", "name": "scope", "value": "chkp-mcp/invoke", "type": "string"}
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "6f3c1d2e-0002-4a00-9000-000000000002",
      "name": "Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [220, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $json.tokenUrl }}",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpBasicAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "form-urlencoded",
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {"name": "grant_type", "value": "client_credentials"},
            {"name": "scope", "value": "={{ $json.scope }}"}
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "6f3c1d2e-0003-4a00-9000-000000000003",
      "name": "Get Cognito token",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [440, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Config').item.json.baseUrl }}/v1/chat",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [{"name": "Authorization", "value": "=Bearer {{ $json.access_token }}"}]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ prompt: $('When chat message received').item.json.chatInput }) }}",
        "options": {"allowUnauthorizedCerts": true, "timeout": 180000}
      },
      "id": "6f3c1d2e-0004-4a00-9000-000000000004",
      "name": "Ask the Check Point agent",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [660, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {"id": "o1", "name": "output", "type": "string",
             "value": "={{ $json.result }}\n\n— {{ $json.model }} · tools: {{ $json.tool_calls.map(t => t.name).join(', ') || 'none' }} · {{ $json.cache_hit_pct }}% of input from cache"}
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "6f3c1d2e-0005-4a00-9000-000000000005",
      "name": "Answer",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [880, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Ask the Check Point security-ops agent\nChat → Cognito token → `POST /v1/chat` on the EKS agent → answer.\nThe agent picks the Check Point MCP tools itself and answers from real tool output.\n\n**Setup (once)**\n1. **Config**: set `baseUrl` and `tokenUrl` from `python -m chkpmcpeks endpoints`.\n2. **Get Cognito token**: create a *Basic Auth* credential — user = client id, password = client secret (`chkpmcpeks endpoints --reveal-secret`).\n3. Open the chat and ask: *What is the reputation of https://www.checkpoint.com?*\n\n*Ignore SSL Issues* is on only because the demo ALB uses a self-signed certificate — turn it off once you set a real domain.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "6f3c1d2e-0006-4a00-9000-000000000006",
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-40, -60]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "When chat message received": {"main": [[{"node": "Config", "type": "main", "index": 0}]]},
    "Config": {"main": [[{"node": "Get Cognito token", "type": "main", "index": 0}]]},
    "Get Cognito token": {"main": [[{"node": "Ask the Check Point agent", "type": "main", "index": 0}]]},
    "Ask the Check Point agent": {"main": [[{"node": "Answer", "type": "main", "index": 0}]]}
  },
  "settings": {"executionOrder": "v1"},
  "pinData": {}
}
